Error: Authentication required.

Option 1: OAuth Token (Recommended)
  OAuth respects your user-specific permissions in Nestr.
  Use an OAuth Bearer token from the Nestr OAuth flow.

  Then set: export NESTR_OAUTH_TOKEN=your-oauth-token

Option 2: API Key
  API keys have full workspace access (ignores user permissions).
  1. Go to your Nestr workspace
  2. Click Settings (gear icon)
  3. Go to Integrations tab
  4. Find 'Workspace API access' and click Configure
  5. Create a new API key

  Then set: export NESTR_API_KEY=your-api-key

Or configure in your MCP client (e.g., Claude Desktop):
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "nestr": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@nestr/mcp"
      ],
      "env": {
        "NESTR_OAUTH_TOKEN": "your-oauth-token"
      }
    }
  }
}
